      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At the Muzaffarpur site the final delivery and uncrating protocol is designed to guarantee that every item arrives in perfect condition, matches the contract documentation, and is ready for immediate use. The process is carried out during daylight hours to maximize visibility and safety, and each step is recorded for audit purposes.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
