    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Final sign‑off</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The site manager conducts a walk‑through, confirming that verification, testing, placement, and cleanup meet the company’s quality standards. A signed delivery receipt is then issued to the client, completing the hand‑over.</p>
